<title>CHINA: China wheat imports down 9.4 pct yr/yr in Jan-Sept.</title>
<headline>China wheat imports down 9.4 pct yr/yr in Jan-Sept.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 6.34 million tonnes of wheat in the first nine months of this year, down 9.4 percent from the same 1995 period, according to customs figures quoted by the Futures Herald newspaper.</p>
<p>China's wheat imports were 250,000 tonnes in June alone, the figures showed.</p>
</text>
